  "bodyHash": "zNXiEBoXVdQ=",
  "content": "<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/bisect\"><img width=100% src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702795/bisect.png\"></a>\n<center>\n    <iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/l2P5w9AkEiQ\" width=\"100%\"></iframe>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquamirae-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=3d215c\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n### <center>Aquamirae 以冰凍海洋生態系擴展你的世界——上方是冰之迷宮，下方是令人戰慄的沉船墓地。探索其獨特的生態系統、進程、氛圍與故事，揭開船長科妮莉亞的命運，在冰層之下潛伏的恐怖中存活下來。</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699368/header/features.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n### 「曾經無邊無際的海洋，其海水曾被狂風從深處掀起，那曾被勇敢航海者與可怕掠奪者艦隊所航行的海洋，如今已被冰雪所束縛。」\n\n### 「時間冰封...那些不幸者的船隻在無情的冰層中凍結，與此同時，可怕的生物從深淵爬出，來到日光之下。在暴風雪中，只能聽見那些仍懷抱獲救希望的人所吹響的罕見號角聲。是什麼能如此劇烈地改變這片曾經狂野不羈的海洋？」\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/k23mNPhZ/images/28676dc18ec5f5acaabcd64c3886a45d30b50607.jpeg\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>冰之迷宮</h1>\n            <p>一座冰凍的迷宮聳立於沉船墓地上方，形成一個充滿危險與秘密的雙層生態系。探索蜿蜒的走廊、塌陷的甲板、隱藏的密室，以及冰層下沉默的殘骸。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>結構與氛圍</h1>\n            <p>從廢棄的營地到巨大的冰凍殘骸，生態系的每個角落都提供了探索之處與待發掘的故事。自訂音樂、詭異的環境音效和飄落的雪花，讓每次遠征都成為一場充滿氛圍的旅程。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769701551/showcase-2.png\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769701551/showcase-3.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>冰層下的生物</h1>\n            <p>深淵中誕生的恐怖生物已浮出水面，迫使當地的掠奪者艦隊躲藏起來。這些生物並非只是棲息在迷宮中——它們從冰層下方湧出，將任何膽敢靠近的人逼入最偏遠的角落以求安全。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>船長科妮莉亞</h1>\n            <p>這位幽靈船長以流暢的動作與致命的能力守護著沉船墓地的心臟地帶。她悲慘的故事透過環境與她留下的寶藏逐步揭曉。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769701551/showcase-4.png\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769701551/showcase-5.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>寶藏與自訂</h1>\n            <p>發現散落在生態系各處的獨特武器、帶有特殊加成的盔甲組，以及稀有飾品。完整的設定支援讓你可以微調生成、難度、戰利品及各項功能，完美融入你的世界。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://i.imgur.com/gaxlKkX.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"15%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cCXV545X/b5b15a5fdab90a6075408aae2ed1c204dbcf0043.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae-delight\">Aquamirae Delight</a> 由 tinfoilknight 製作</h1>\n            <p>Aquamirae Delight 是 Farmer's Delight 與 Aquamirae 的相容性模組。它新增了多道菜餚與改良的配方，同時忠於兩款模組的主題、食材與遊戲風格，維持了連貫的原版體驗。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699408/header/more-from-obscuria.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/aquamirae.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/obscure-tooltips\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/obscure-tooltips.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pillager-caravans\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/pillager-caravans.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-elixirum\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/ars-elixirum.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/accents\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/blank.png\" width=\"45%\" />\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/patreon.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/discord.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>",
